---
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Private pay & self-pay rates.

   Self-pay or uninsured comes up on 33 of 571 Buena Vista calls (6%), with a
   further 29 asking price directly.

   RATES — the figures published here are the client wiki's: detox $1,000/day,
   residential $750/day. Admissions corroborates the detox figure most often as
   "$7,000 for seven days", and residential as "about $23,000 for 30 days".

   HOWEVER — quotes given by phone are NOT consistent. One agent quotes $10,000
   for a private-pay detox where others quote $7,000, and other figures appear
   in the export too. Publishing a rate is partly a fix for that: a number on
   the page is a number everyone can quote from. Flag any change here to
   admissions so the phone script matches.

   Rates are framed as typical and assessment-dependent, and the page promises
   a written figure before commitment. Do not harden into a fixed price list
   without billing sign-off.

   ⚠ NO SURPRISES ACT — publishing self-pay rates brings Good Faith Estimate
   obligations for uninsured and self-pay patients. The GFE page was cut from
   the sitemap; the written-confirmation promise in the copy points that way but
   is not a substitute for a compliant GFE process. Raise with the client before
   this page goes live.

   STYLE: no call-data sourcing, no exclusionary framing.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';

import PrivatePayHero from '../../components/privatepay/PrivatePayHero.astro';
import WhatItCosts from '../../components/privatepay/WhatItCosts.astro';
import WhyPrivatePay from '../../components/privatepay/WhyPrivatePay.astro';
import PrivatePayQuestions from '../../components/privatepay/PrivatePayQuestions.astro';

import Testimonials from '../../components/Testimonials.astro';
import VerifySection from '../../components/VerifySection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';

const title = 'Private Pay & Self-Pay Rates | Buena Vista Health & Recovery, Chandler AZ';
const description =
  'What detox and residential treatment costs in Chandler, AZ without insurance. Day rates, what is included, and a written figure before you commit. Call (888) 362-5576.';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    ['How much does rehab cost without insurance in Arizona?',
     'Buena Vista works from day rates of around $1,000 per day for medical detox and around $750 per day for residential treatment. A seven-day detox is roughly $7,000 and a thirty-day residential stay roughly $22,500. Your figure depends on the length of stay indicated by your assessment and is confirmed in writing beforehand.'],
    ['What is included in the private pay rate?',
     'Your room, all meals, the clinical programme, medical supervision and the amenities. Detox and residential are priced as day rates covering the whole stay.'],
    ['Is it cheaper to do detox and residential together?',
     'Yes. Moving from detox directly into residential is priced as one continuous stay rather than two admissions, which is lower than the two quoted separately.'],
    ['Should I check insurance even if I plan to pay privately?',
     'Yes. Coverage is often better than expected, and a benefits check takes a few minutes at no cost.'],
  ].map(([q, a]) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a },
  })),
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <TopBar />
  <Nav />

  <PrivatePayHero />
  <WhatItCosts />
  <WhyPrivatePay />
  <Testimonials />
  <VerifySection />
  <PrivatePayQuestions />

  <FinalCTA />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} is:inline />
</Layout>
